/-!
# Operational integration of named rewriting profiles

Admitted firing paths connect to the existing operational correspondence
machinery. Directed descriptor evaluation, fresh rule-program openings,
stored-rule interpretation, named alternative histories, authored machine
execution and checked cell updates retain their stated representations.

Whole plain and sequencing-source configurations correspond to one native
frontier controller, with partial answer bags, failure retirement and progress.
The by-value function-variable fragment is an actual instance. Checked row
answers in the declared recursion class agree with directed descriptor runs
and retain their computed types. The finite nineteen-rule
program computes arbitrary partial-recursive codes through actual runs and
retains their budgets, prefix words and resumption endpoints; its executable
table driver uses the existing matcher and the actual compiled schemas. World-candidate
adapters separate local firings from unrestricted world-management moves.

The included controls distinguish conversion from execution, named choices
from raw firings, and finite correspondence from administrative progress.
The actual checked-definition compiler reaches the public source query and
whole-frontier value observations, with reverse execution and closed-machine
normalization. Persistent live-rule runs retain their origin choices over
each actual base firing, including multiplicity over complete runs.
The actual compiler supplies the ground-dependency licence that transports
termination through source configurations and the public continuation. The
general normal-form program also reaches a native frontier with its actual
public bind, prefix answer bags and progress correspondence. Its root probes
and root-test executions are checked. The recursive source scanner returns
its marker exactly for normal forms and always terminates on scoped native
input. Public source and frontier answers are exactly reachable directed
native normal forms, and native directed accessibility gives termination of
the actual public source and controller. An exact package's preservation
licence, or the qualified vector package on old terms, gives result typing;
qualification of arbitrary new definitions is not inferred from compilation.
Verdict-compiled calls earn the required support licence from typing and
freshness and agree with the existing qualified descriptor execution for
general normal results, even beside an unrelated typing-refused raw row.
These bridges retain their named commitment, knowledge
and rule-storage profiles; they select no common default.
The generic GSLT path and readback laws apply to the supplied theories,
without fixing their store or commit construction. Concrete first-order
programs here use occurrence bags, one match, guards after own tells, a
fixed set of rules and one knowledge store. World and live-rule bridges
replace their stated axes under explicit scope and origin hypotheses;
their comparisons do not include arbitrary management moves or rule updates.
For the interpreted native queue, actual events consume one shared pending
occurrence, so a pairwise independent family has at most one member. Other
native stores admit larger rounds. Serial grouping of two queue events has
an exact two-step path realization and cannot reuse zero-or-one-step
readback with the unchanged input-word observation. These are scoped
commit-grain results, not a choice of a universal primitive.
The received HOL path definitions are instantiated for checked cells.
The actual native record case and instance contracts correspond to prepared
field-rule admission with their source guards, result effects and explicit
permission in the same source model. Closed-packet proof transport and the
concrete native consumer and stream-lifecycle refinement remain open.
Exact registered proof blocks and sized Array views support concrete proof
quotation while preserving every parent address and receipt. Proof suffixes
carry one chosen source interpretation. The product constructor earns its
projection and reconstruction readings through actual primitive checks and
uses them with the native instance contract in that same carried model.
The numbered-syntax adapters join actual input records to source-node cache
licences, preserve identifiers through staged prefixes, and retain signature
checking separately from parsing. The local theorem-row word adapter consumes
an actual checked load while keeping its source-image licence explicit.
Certificate-origin laws identify the original prepared program's missing
ingress rather than supplying an alternative lifecycle implicitly.
Checked registry transport and total reference queries connect successful
syntax-cache reads to the numbered proof reader. Its raw input windows yield
actual registered paths with distinct event serials, output IDs and ordered
parent occurrences. Fixed-policy, signature and claimed-output checks remain
separate from request preparation. Raw definition and type-definition
reception retain the actual admitted context, parent lookup and ordered
outputs. A shared metadata law connects source conclusions to their checked
cache addresses through actual reception. One total dispatcher composes
these readers on mixed raw input windows, retaining one actual registered
event per record and both outputs of a type declaration. It preserves the
input and source-conclusion law through each actual intermediate state;
declarations may extend the symbol registry. The numeric-pair installer compiles
a checked three-premise block and relocates it into the supplied cache while
carrying its chosen model; the actual original numeric-history instance and
complete file/native reception remain separate obligations.
-/
